WEBVTT

NOTE
Original audio description written by AniNusa (CC0).
Film: Sintel (Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0).

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Wind blows across the mountains]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A young wanderer finds a wounded baby dragon.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
She cares for it and gives it a name.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Their friendship grows day by day.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Then the dragon disappears.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
The wanderer begins a long journey to find it.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
She crosses deserts, ruins, and snowy peaks.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
In a cave, she finds a clue about her dragon.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Battle and sacrifice change her path.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:03:00.000
[Emotional music]

00:03:00.000 --> 00:04:00.000
A story about loss and hope.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:14:48.000
[Credits and closing music]
